# DeepSeek 分流规则集 (建议策略: DIRECT)
# 匹配类型,匹配模式,策略

# --- 1. 核心主域名 (覆盖官网、Web端、API) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepseek.com,DIRECT

# --- 2. 开发者平台与文档 (Platform & API Docs) ---
DOMAIN,platform.deepseek.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,api-docs.deepseek.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,api.deepseek.com,DIRECT

# --- 3. 依赖的第三方风控与前端资源 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fengkongcloud.cn,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fengkongcloud.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,portal101.cn,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,portal101.com,DIRECT

# --- 4. 统计与客服组件 (Sentry, Intercom等) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com,DIRECT

# --- 5. 字节跳动相关服务 (Volces 火山引擎) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,volces.com,DIRECT

